{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"645655885607561a315b70eaa42115c817551a6786cf35facd833e9663c4c970","ja":"美味しいが迷子！？","zh":"美味跑哪儿去了！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"02dbfeded00acbaec60245a1bc9be73573c44fef263b60e8f662148000d0a6e0","ja":"……いえ。すみません、真さん。\nやっぱり、もう少し生地をこねてもらえますか？","zh":"……没有。对不起，真。\n还是能请你再揉一会儿面团吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b1f9f6e39d1d8df38148ca2fd8f26b539ffbe8f6e1e96419fcc168d2d3d619af","ja":"それと、心置きなくおかわりしてもらえるように、\n追加で生地をこねてもらってもいいでしょうか！？","zh":"还有，为了能让大家毫无顾虑地再来一份，\n能请您再多揉一些面团吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e06b8e64b5091e09a474f01ce621e9610c6a06afd794950b7d619c099559eab4","ja":"ええっ！？　これだけあれば十分じゃないかな？\nボク達が一緒に食べても、食べきれないと思うよ。","zh":"咦！？有这么多不是已经足够了吗？\n我觉得就算我们一起吃，也吃不完呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e96a393c0ef4bfe83c53b012f0bc1f035d61cd8fd503f09c0ffc497e31bb91d4","ja":"そうでしょうか……？　ああ、でもたしかに、\n作りすぎて余らせても、もったいないですね……。","zh":"是这样吗……？啊，不过确实，\n要是做太多剩下的话，也挺可惜的呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"837e77c079a532e3f7dfbd3cfd5dac7c1b67deaf67a877089f2823f6fad88041","ja":"わかりました。真さんは引き続き生地をお願いします。\n私はもうちょっと、出汁を調整してみます！","zh":"明白了。真就继续麻烦你负责面糊了。\n我再试着稍微调整一下高汤！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a27638775aa01ed855697e8dbc3a45c54a1319d73c084303462b9fa20ebd3916","ja":"「さて、うどん作りもいよいよ佳境！\nゆでた麵を出汁につけて味見をしています！」","zh":"「那么，乌冬面的制作也终于到了最精彩的关头！\n现在正把煮好的面蘸上高汤试吃呢！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"816261cec3fb83157380d2f0ee2002d2d81c1801c96e99b6cdd9f90e8597ce8b","ja":"……麺のコシが足りないかも。ゆで時間が\n長かったのかな……それとも、お塩の量を間違えた？","zh":"……面可能不够劲道。是煮得太久了\n吗……还是说，盐放的分量不对？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1776132c4eec2b04e545c20493ff9e8b5a7cd715b45f99a763de0519e374c0f3","ja":"それに出汁も、あれこれ混ぜすぎて\nかえって味がぼやけてしまった気が……？","zh":"而且高汤也因为混了太多种，\n反而让人觉得味道有点模糊了……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"8523c9b97baa8a30e16236be243ad87f6012dc936e93c5ffd159a9fab4885fea","ja":"……あのっ、真さん！\n一から全部作り直してもいいでしょうか！？","zh":"……那个，真小姐！\n能让我从头全部重做一遍吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"650aa2162d7d48f1253737f5b50fef20bc8cd8597ec8ee59e96f6d00a02505b5","ja":"ええっ！？　ちょ、ちょっと待って！\n最初からやり直すつもりなの！？","zh":"咦咦！？等、等等！\n你打算从头重新开始吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b10505b9082a883b2b6d18aaa1776c05d1be4e44c4df0a4b5acc32e4f95e1006","ja":"はい……味見すればするほど、ゲストにお出しする\n最高のうどんには相応しくない気がして……！","zh":"是的……越是试吃，就越觉得配不上\n要端给客人的绝品乌冬面……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a742699322e96f28e19e899ddc731d13073598878930994979dbfa64e807fe45","ja":"（うーん……考えすぎちゃって、\n自分でもわからなくなってるんじゃないかな……）","zh":"（唔……是不是想得太多，\n连自己都搞不明白了呢……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"22a47aa21390eba5084199f07190ee4590d2b7b18d877057144480d5a1cb0c24","ja":"そうだ！　ボクも味見してみるよ。\n作り直すかは、それから決めてもいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"对了！我也来尝尝味道吧。\n要不要重做，等尝过之后再决定也不迟吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
